@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram for Ott Based System Mini Reel

state Start
state LoggedOut
state WatchVideos
state UploadVideo
state SaveVideo
state ViewSavedVideos
state EnterDiscussion
state BlogsNewsUpdates
state AccountCreation
state IncorrectDetails
state SignIn
state NewCase
state CaseDetails
state Reminders
state DocumentUpload
state OttBasedSystem

AccountCreation --* LoggedOut: Create Account
LoggedOut --> WatchVideos: Login Successful
WatchVideos --> UploadVideo: User chooses to upload video
UploadVideo --> SaveVideo: User saves video during viewing
SaveVideo --> ViewSavedVideos: User views saved videos
ViewSavedVideos --> EnterDiscussion: User enters discussion option
BlogsNewsUpdates --* Start: Explore blogs and news updates
Start --> AccountCreation: User decides to create an account
AccountCreation --> IncorrectDetails: Provided details are incorrect
IncorrectDetails --> AccountCreation: Retry with correct details
SignIn --* LoggedOut: Sign in using password
SignIn --> NewCase: User adds a new case after signing in
NewCase --> CaseDetails: User enters details for the selected category
CaseDetails --> Reminders: User sets reminders
Reminders --> DocumentUpload: User uploads related documents
DocumentUpload --> OttBasedSystem: User completes adding case details
OttBasedSystem --> LoggedOut: User logs out at any time
@enduml
